&_nc_oc=AdqKzCjy6UTKoLNnk4CSqWFBXA2yXcEX6kj9Gaha40zqtx54kMDafGQ4y6bjlwA2czw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFhkwlY4ltGpUZo81ORllSYR7vSkBQkEw31Rn4ZrcS4Gw&oe=6A7899BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kX1ox8BxbKwQ7kNvwFDwCGA&_nc_oc=AdpRlYSDROq9cqGOghAzwgoL-GgK8MxvfQJrNYgAsUAJr3rQXDmnr7qF9EXcLOi4Szg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGXQ7Y_KtCTukW4ZACfMpbE6V36DhwDNL0ZrYWCALMGTw&oe=6A78727C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-vieXLCjVY0Q7kNvwGEPRO4&_nc_oc=AdobZ3CUV1NRkscbfHZMT3jArZQNZI1NmX_H9nQ-U0u9n_ffrLT22Ho2TiboiEhk7hA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE_yQw_xqpUj3dSMKywp7HIgY4Hl1g7rzrzq-MOaWOc2Q&oe=6A789107"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c23mzRXDNu0Q7kNvwEMurS2&_nc_oc=AdrFfC9sT8CUB8fWeJxMVUeypD-bMZSd1bwdkAm1VXjiRlrntfqajWjCdFt_saTm7NY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHpu_1acV053NrtUOqE_AAUGcnqSwLRbUCM3J6h0ZKl0g&oe=6A787CD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AYAlXunbOIsQ7kNvwEMgO_B&_nc_oc=AdoxkEw0AX8DdalIaY-z9o1fDTNTV80PHZfD-1rbcIVI9ntgz_Tp46dhgzVOs6vczHE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHOES-CpK6O1yz9GqWTMc0w8fpy0vdarez-eqfw3pifLQ&oe=6A788964"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.